      "modificationTime": "2022-01-03T16:07:22.372435Z",
      "description": "## Overview\n[lodash](https://www.npmjs.com/package/lodash) is a modern JavaScript utility library delivering modularity, performance, & extras.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Prototype Pollution via the `zipObjectDeep` function. When provided with malicious property paths, it is possible to modify the prototype of `Object`, causing the addition or modification of an existing property that will exist on all objects.\n\n## PoC\n```js\nconst _ = require('lodash');\n_.zipObjectDeep(['__proto__.z'], [123]);\nconsole.log(z); // 123\n```\n\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `lodash` to version 4.17.16 or higher.\n\n## References\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/lodash/lodash/commit/c84fe82760fb2d3e03a63379b297a1cc1a2fce12)\n- [HackerOne Report](https://hackerone.com/reports/712065)\n",
      "from": [
        "xpsd-fixture-app@1.0.0",
        "lodash@4.17.15"
      ],
      "upgradePath": [
        false,
        "lodash@4.17.16"
      ],
      "isUpgradable": true,
      "isPatchable": false,
      "name": "lodash",
      "version": "4.17.15"
    },
