      "description": "## Overview\n[lodash](https://www.npmjs.com/package/lodash) is a modern JavaScript utility library delivering modularity, performance, & extras.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Command Injection via the `template` function. The `variable` option of `_.template` is not sanitized, allowing arbitrary code to be injected into the compiled template function.\n\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `lodash` to version 4.17.21 or higher.\n\n## References\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/lodash/lodash/commit/3469357cff396a26c363f8c1b5a91dde28ba4b1c)\n",
