      "description": "## Overview\n[ansi-regex](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ansi-regex) is a regular expression for matching ANSI escape codes.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Regular Expression Denial of Service (ReDoS) due to a sub-pattern with quantified overlapping adjacency. Matching crafted invalid ANSI escape codes can take polynomial time in the input length.\n\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `ansi-regex` to version 3.0.1, 4.1.1, 5.0.1, 6.0.1 or higher.\n",
