      "description": "## Overview\n[node-fetch](https://www.npmjs.com/package/node-fetch) is a light-weight module that brings window.fetch to node.js.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Information Exposure when fetching a remote URL that redirects to a different origin: `Cookie`, `Authorization` and `WWW-Authenticate` headers are forwarded to the new origin.\n\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `node-fetch` to version 2.6.7, 3.1.1 or higher.\n",
